      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What exactly are you wanting to test on the Quest avatars? I guess the cross platform parameter sync would be useful to test (if toggles sync up properly) but personally I've been letting VRCFury handle that.\n\nI do end up reminding people that the \"Quest\" version of an avatar can be uploaded to PC.",
