  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Allow PC users to show the Quest version of an avatar. They're nicer than imposters and fallbacks while still saving on performance. This would also allow users to test quest avatars without having to own a quest. This could be done through shield settings, the profile menu, or an option in the settings like \"Show Mobile Avatar\".",
